  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 758854,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 1 Across 2 Down: A Retro Crossword Challenge for the Amiga\n\nStep back in time and test your vocabulary with *1 Across 2 Down*, a charming and straightforward crossword puzzle game for the Commodore Amiga. This isn't your frantic, timer-driven puzzle experience; instead, it's a relaxed and rewarding challenge focused on pure deduction. \n\nThe game presents eight meticulously crafted, pre-made crosswords, each waiting for your linguistic prowess.  You’ll decipher clues and carefully fill in the grid, relying on your knowledge and intuition.  A verification feature allows you to check your answers, providing subtle hints without giving away the solution entirely. \n\n*1 Across 2 Down* offers a simple yet engaging gameplay loop. There's no pressure of a ticking clock, allowing you to savor each clue and meticulously consider your options.  However, once you’ve conquered all eight crosswords, the game concludes, offering a satisfying sense of accomplishment.  A perfect title for Amiga enthusiasts and crossword lovers alike, *1 Across 2 Down* provides a nostalgic and brain-teasing experience."
    },
